
                   **********************************
                   New Hydrocarbon Torsion Parameters
                            for OPLS-AA
                   **********************************

As of 11/99, the 3 basic alkane torsions are being changed as 
follows to better reproduce exptl data (rather than 6-31G*).

                    V1       V2      V3
HC-CT-CT-HC          0        0     0.318   OPLS-AA
                     0        0     0.300   new

HC-CT-CT-CT          0        0     0.366   OPLS-AA
                     0        0     0.300   new

CT-CT-CT-CT        1.74     -0.157  0.279   OPLS-AA
                   1.30     -0.050  0.200   new

